                <pb facs="0373" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg261"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">memorandum.</hi></head>
                <p>The Imperial Government has taken note with lively interest of the memorandum of
                    the embassy of the United States of America dated December 17, 1909, on the
                    subject of the questions of policy in China. It is glad to declare its assent to
                    the general principle developed in the memorandum, inasmuch as this principle is
                    in full accord with the policy of the open door for China advocated by the
                    Imperial Government.</p>
            </div>
